Aim: Implement multiple methods declared in an interface.

Algorithm: Start
declare interface methods
implement all
invoke
stop.

Program:

interface Shape {
    void draw();
    void color();
}
class Circle implements Shape {
    public void draw(){System.out.println("Drawing circle");}
    public void color(){System.out.println("Red");}
}
class InterfaceDemo {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Circle c=new Circle(); c.draw(); c.color();
    }
}

Result: Drawing circle; Red
